00:00:07.652 --> 00:00:09.720
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE HEAR ABOUT

00:00:09.053 --> 00:00:11.923
CELEBRITIES CALLING FOR GUN

00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:13.057
CONTROL BUT THEN THEY STARTED

00:00:12.056 --> 00:00:13.357
MOVIES THAT PROMINENTLY FEATURE

00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:14.525
THEM.

00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:15.827
WE HAVE CALLED THEM OUT FOR

00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:17.929
THEIR HYPOCRISY AT THIS TABLE

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.197
OVER THE YEARS BUT ACTOR ETHAN

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:21.766
HAWKE IS OFFERING SOME

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.066
REFRESHING HONESTY ON THE ISSUE.

00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:23.234
WATCH.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.969
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE TALKING SO MUCH ABOUT

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:27.371
GUN CONTROL IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:00:25.102 --> 00:00:29.707
I NOTICED RECENTLY IF YOU PUT IN

00:00:27.505 --> 00:00:31.909
A COLUMN EVERY MOVIE I EVER DID

00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:32.944
WHERE I CARRY A GUN AND WHERE I

00:00:32.043 --> 00:00:34.745
DON'T AND MY SALARY.

00:00:33.077 --> 00:00:36.914
IF I ASKED MY FATHER TO DO THE

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:40.484
MATH ON THIS, I THINK IT WOULD

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:41.786
BE ABOUT 92% TO 8%.

00:00:40.618 --> 00:00:43.521
&gt;&gt; Dana: SORRY, I THOUGHT I

00:00:41.919 --> 00:00:45.756
WAS GOING TO BE EVEN HAWKE.

00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:46.757
IT WAS MIKE BAKER FROM IDAHO.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:48.993
JUST KIDDING.

00:00:46.891 --> 00:00:50.394
OBVIOUSLY THAT WAS ETHAN HAWKE.

00:00:49.126 --> 00:00:53.364
IT'S TRUE ABOUT CIGARETTES TOO.

00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:54.131
&gt;&gt; Greg: YES.

00:00:53.497 --> 00:00:56.133
IF HOLLYWOOD ACTUALLY BELIEVED

00:00:54.265 --> 00:00:57.168
IN THEIR CAUSES, THERE WOULD BE

00:00:56.267 --> 00:01:01.272
NO GUNS AT ALL.

00:00:57.301 --> 00:01:02.940
YOU CAN IMAGINE IN "DIE HARD,"

00:01:01.405 --> 00:01:03.641
BRUCE McLEAN FIGHTING

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:05.943
TERRORISTS WITH A PEACE SIGN.

00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:07.745
I HAVE AN IDEA.

00:01:06.077 --> 00:01:08.145
THEY SHOULD APPLY GUN-CONTROL TO

00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:11.916
MOVIE GUNS.

00:01:08.279 --> 00:01:13.384
THE ONLY WAY YOU CAN DO THIS IS

00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:14.285
TAX MOVIES BY AMOUNTS OF GUNS

00:01:13.517 --> 00:01:19.557
AND BY THE AMOUNT OF BULLETS

00:01:14.418 --> 00:01:20.157
THEY USE FOR MOVIES.

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.493
HOLLYWOOD'S GUN-CONTROL

00:01:20.291 --> 00:01:27.331
ACTIVISTS, AND THERE ARE LOTS OF

00:01:22.627 --> 00:01:29.133
THEM, WILL THEY BE OKAY FOR A

00:01:27.465 --> 00:01:29.734
GUN-CONTROL TAX ON MOVIES WITH

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:30.968
GUNS?

00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:33.404
TAX THE BULLETS.

00:01:31.102 --> 00:01:34.605
$10,000 EVERY TIME THERE IS A

00:01:33.537 --> 00:01:35.973
BULLET.

00:01:34.739 --> 00:01:36.841
$100,000 FOR A GUN.

00:01:36.107 --> 00:01:38.175
WOULD THEY DO IT?

00:01:36.974 --> 00:01:38.943
SOMEBODY SHOULD INTRODUCE APPLE

00:01:38.309 --> 00:01:39.810
TOMORROW.

00:01:39.076 --> 00:01:43.180
I AM FULL OF IDEAS.

00:01:39.944 --> 00:01:44.548
&gt;&gt; Dana: THAT IS A GOOD IDEA.

00:01:43.314 --> 00:01:46.617
WHAT ETHAN HAWKE IS SAYING THAT

00:01:44.682 --> 00:01:48.219
IN MOVIES WHERE THERE IS GUNS HE

00:01:46.751 --> 00:01:50.955
GETS PAID 92% MORE THAN IF HE

00:01:48.352 --> 00:01:52.823
DIDN'T HAVE A GUN IN A MOVIE.

00:01:51.088 --> 00:01:53.624
HE WOULD GET PAID ABOUT 8% OF

00:01:52.957 --> 00:01:54.625
HIS USUAL.

00:01:53.758 --> 00:01:55.993
&gt;&gt; Jesse: HOLLYWOOD MADE

00:01:54.759 --> 00:01:58.229
MILLIONS OFF HIS GUNS.

00:01:56.127 --> 00:02:01.032
ALL OF THE ACTION MOVIES IN THE

00:01:58.362 --> 00:02:03.501
'80 ZEN '.

00:02:01.165 --> 00:02:06.771
DIE-HARD, ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER,

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:08.572
EVERYONE HAS A GUN.

00:02:06.904 --> 00:02:10.574
&gt;&gt; Greg: QUENTIN TARANTINO.

00:02:08.706 --> 00:02:11.742
&gt;&gt; Jesse: ALL OF THAT STUFF

00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:12.977
MADE OF FORTUNE FOR THE STUDIOS.

00:02:11.876 --> 00:02:14.979
THEN COME AROUND AND SAY YOU

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:15.746
WANT TO TAKE AWAY GUNS FROM

00:02:15.112 --> 00:02:17.348
LAW-ABIDING AMERICANS.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.449
IT'S A LITTLE HYPOCRITICAL.

00:02:17.481 --> 00:02:19.183
I WANTED TO BRING SOMETHING TO

00:02:18.582 --> 00:02:20.785
YOUR ATTENTION.

00:02:19.317 --> 00:02:22.553
THIS HAPPENED YESTERDAY.

00:02:20.918 --> 00:02:24.488
THERE WAS A SCHOOL SHOOTING, A

00:02:22.687 --> 00:02:25.990
19-YEAR-OLD BROUGHT A GUN AND

00:02:24.622 --> 00:02:26.824
STARTED OPENING FIRE IN A SCHOOL

00:02:26.123 --> 00:02:29.327
IN ILLINOIS AND AN ARMED

00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:31.262
RESOURCE OFFICER SHOT HIM,

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.762
NEUTRALIZED THEM, DIDN'T KILL

00:02:31.395 --> 00:02:32.964
HIM.

00:02:31.896 --> 00:02:33.597
SAVED COUNTLESS LIVES.

00:02:33.097 --> 00:02:36.067
THAT STORY WAS NOT COVERED

00:02:33.731 --> 00:02:35.666
ANYWHERE IN THE MAINSTREAM MEDIA

00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:36.367
ANYWHERE IN THE MAINSTREAM MEDI

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.737
MEDIA.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.538
&gt;&gt; Greg: I WAS GOING TO DO IT

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.039
TOMORROW IN THE MONOLOGUE.

00:02:40.671 --> 00:02:42.340
&gt;&gt; Juan: AN EXCEPTION TO THE

00:02:42.173 --> 00:02:43.975
RULE.

00:02:42.473 --> 00:02:45.743
&gt;&gt; Greg: SO IT IS THE RULE.

00:02:44.108 --> 00:02:47.278
&gt;&gt; Juan: HERE'S THE THING.

00:02:45.876 --> 00:02:49.080
WHEN PEOPLE COMPLAIN ABOUT

00:02:47.411 --> 00:02:50.381
SMOKING IN MOVIES, IT HAD AN

00:02:49.213 --> 00:02:51.182
IMPACT.

00:02:50.514 --> 00:02:52.283
WHEN PEOPLE COMPLAINED --

00:02:51.315 --> 00:02:55.353
&gt;&gt; Dana: THEY STILL DO IT.

00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:59.390
&gt;&gt; Juan: THEY DO IT MUCH LAST.

00:02:55.486 --> 00:03:01.058
YOU THINK ABOUT HOW GAYS WERE

00:02:59.523 --> 00:03:01.759
DEMONIZED IN MOVIES, NOW IT'S

00:03:01.192 --> 00:03:03.828
NOT AN ISSUE.

00:03:01.892 --> 00:03:05.563
MORE BLACK ACTORS UP FOR

00:03:03.961 --> 00:03:06.697
COMPETITION IN LEEDS AND BIG

00:03:05.696 --> 00:03:08.366
MOVIES.

00:03:06.831 --> 00:03:10.334
IT DOES MAKE A DIFFERENCE.

00:03:08.499 --> 00:03:12.770
TO SAY GUNS HAVE MADE MONEY FOR

00:03:10.468 --> 00:03:14.538
HOLLYWOOD, IN THE WAY, IT SEEMS

00:03:12.903 --> 00:03:15.973
TO ME, IT ENCOURAGES THEIR

00:03:14.672 --> 00:03:19.143
CULTURE.

00:03:16.107 --> 00:03:19.777
I GO TO THINGS LIKE GUNSMOKE,

00:03:19.276 --> 00:03:21.946
JOHN WAYNE, INDEPENDENT,

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:23.781
SELF-SUFFICIENT AMERICAN MALE.

00:03:22.079 --> 00:03:25.649
BUT I WONDER IF AT SOME POINT IT

00:03:23.914 --> 00:03:26.183
WOULDN'T BE, WE CAN HAVE A

00:03:25.783 --> 00:03:30.121
DISCUSSION ABOUT IT.

00:03:26.317 --> 00:03:31.956
JUST BECAUSE IT'S GUNS DOESN'T

00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:33.424
MEAN YOU CAN'T DISCUSS IT.

00:03:32.089 --> 00:03:35.459
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHEN YOU SAY GUNS

00:03:33.557 --> 00:03:35.860
ENCOURAGE THE CULTURE, WHAT DO

00:03:35.593 --> 00:03:37.595
YOU MEAN?

00:03:35.993 --> 00:03:38.429
&gt;&gt; Juan: THEY REFLECT.

00:03:37.728 --> 00:03:39.797
THEY SHAPE THE CULTURE.

00:03:38.562 --> 00:03:40.998
IF YOU ARE A GUY AND YOU SAY I'M

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.199
GOING TO HAVE A GUN.

00:03:41.132 --> 00:03:43.901
I AM A REAL MAN.

00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:46.270
BY THE WAY, I SAW HEAR MORE

00:03:44.035 --> 00:03:49.373
PARENTS SAY AS LONG AS THE

00:03:46.404 --> 00:03:50.474
VIOLENCE IS JUSTIFIED AND LIKE

00:03:49.507 --> 00:03:52.610
SELF-DEFENSE WHEN THEY DON'T

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:53.844
MIND SEEING GUNS IN MOVIES.

00:03:52.743 --> 00:03:54.645
&gt;&gt; Jedediah: SOMETIMES WHEN

00:03:53.978 --> 00:03:56.213
PEOPLE WATCH TELEVISION AND

00:03:54.779 --> 00:03:57.248
MOVIES, THEY JUST WANT TO BE

00:03:56.347 --> 00:03:58.482
ENTERTAINED.

00:03:57.381 --> 00:03:59.917
I THINK ABOUT THIS EFFORT THAT

00:03:58.616 --> 00:04:00.618
COULD SANITIZE THESE THINGS,

00:04:00.051 --> 00:04:03.054
LET'S REMOVE THE VIOLENCE AND

00:04:00.751 --> 00:04:03.988
LET'S ONLY HAVE IT -- THAT IS

00:04:03.187 --> 00:04:04.355
NOT WHAT FILM AND TELEVISION

00:04:04.121 --> 00:04:07.158
SHOULD BE.

00:04:04.488 --> 00:04:08.159
SOME OF MY FAVORITE MOVIES.

00:04:07.291 --> 00:04:10.961
I LOVE LIAM NEESON.

00:04:08.292 --> 00:04:12.063
I LOVE HIM IN THE TAKEN MOVIES.

00:04:11.095 --> 00:04:12.530
SOME OF THESE THINGS RELY ON

00:04:12.196 --> 00:04:14.698
THAT STORY LINE.

00:04:12.663 --> 00:04:16.567
HOW ARE YOU GOING TO HAVE A

00:04:14.832 --> 00:04:18.102
CHASE OR YOU ARE HUNTING DOWN A

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.436
KILLER AND YOU'RE GOING TO HAVE

00:04:18.235 --> 00:04:19.770
NO GUN.

00:04:18.569 --> 00:04:21.839
IT'S INTEGRAL TO THAT.

00:04:19.904 --> 00:04:24.141
I DON'T THINK, IT'S THE SAME

00:04:21.972 --> 00:04:25.810
ARGUMENT PEOPLE MAKE, OH, GREW

00:04:24.275 --> 00:04:27.545
UP PLAYING VIOLENT VIDEO GAMES,

00:04:25.943 --> 00:04:28.779
YOU'RE GOING TO BE VIOLENT.

00:04:27.678 --> 00:04:31.015
IT DOESN'T WORK THAT WAY.

00:04:28.913 --> 00:04:32.716
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SO YOU ARE AGAINST

00:04:31.148 --> 00:04:34.985
GREG'S TAX PLANTED TAXI BULLETS.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.719
&gt;&gt; Greg: I WANT TO SEE THE

00:04:35.119 --> 00:04:37.721
GUN-CONTROL ACTIVISTS IN

00:04:35.853 --> 00:04:41.392
HOLLYWOOD ACCEPT THAT PLAN.

00:04:37.855 --> 00:04:43.194
&gt;&gt; Dana: IT'S TRUE THAT IF YOU

00:04:41.525 --> 00:04:45.062
